    <title>The Abelian Sandpile Model on an Infinite Tree</title>
    <updated>2001-01-05T13:56:17Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/math-ph/0101005v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/math-ph/0101005v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>  We consider the standard Abelian sandpile process on the Bethe lattice. We show the existence of the thermodynamic limit for the finite volume stationary measures and the existence of a unique infinite volume Markov process exhibiting features of self-organized criticality.</summary>
